OL,3,GNEWSANo legal powers for Welsh Covid-19
OL,4,Areview, first minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCovid-19 Bereaved Families for Justice
OL,7,FCymru co-lead Catherine Griffiths
OL,8,Fpreviously said a review without those
OL,9,Fpowers would be a "waste of public
OL,10,Fmoney".
